        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "The Mind-Body Problem: Historical Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "RES COGITANS:        RES EXTENSA:\n  - Thinking           - Extended in space\n  - Unextended         - Divisible\n  - Indivisible        - Mechanical\n  - Immaterial         - Material\n  - The seat of the self - The body, the world\n```"
    },
