        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "The Mind-Body Problem: Historical Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "WHY THIS FAILS:\n  It just pushes the problem back.\n  How does the soul interact with the pineal gland specifically?\n  The problem of interaction is not solved by naming a location.\n  Any proposed mechanism must eventually invoke\n  a soul-to-matter causal contact, which is the original problem."
    },
    {
      "id": "01-MIND-BODY-PROBLEM.md#016",
